  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115788",
      "title": "Component Outputs: Repetition",
      "lectureOrder": 141,
      "videoOrder": 133,
      "sourceHash": "6e6ff9011269b81d79a0f9af25163c1f3299a87162dee6ed4bc81c84737c0eee",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.87,
          "end": 2.97,
          "en": "So when do I want to add a ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 4.68,
          "en": "to this array here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "Well, whenever the user enters the data for a new ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 10.5,
          "en": "and clicked submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 13.41,
          "en": "So onSubmit of the NewTicketComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "I wanna emit a custom event to which I can listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 18.97,
          "en": "from inside the ticket's Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 21.21,
          "en": "and therefore here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.21,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "we can and should add a new property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 27.003,
          "en": "It could be named add, but the name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "and it should be a custom event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 33.82,
          "en": "So we can use the @Output() decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.73,
          "end": 38.17,
          "en": "and set this to be a new EventEmitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.3,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "where output and EventEmitter are both imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 45.933,
          "en": "from Angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "Alternatively, we can set add equal to the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "of calling the output function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 58.83,
          "en": "That's the more modern way of registering that output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.83,
          "end": 60.993,
          "en": "as explained before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "We should then also make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 65.853,
          "en": "which kind of data will be emitted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "And that could be an object where we'll have a title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 73.173,
          "en": "which is a string and a text that is a string, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.09,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "And of course, if you would be using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 79.59,
          "en": "that output decorator based approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.59,
          "end": 83.58,
          "en": "you should also set that type here on EventEmitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.58,
          "end": 85.83,
          "en": "to tell TypeScript which kind of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.83,
          "end": 87.513,
          "en": "will eventually be emitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.59,
          "end": 91.32,
          "en": "Now, with that, we can use this add property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.32,
          "end": 95.37,
          "en": "in onSubmit to call this.add.emit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 97.5,
          "en": "and emit this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "where I set the title to the title I'm getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 101.973,
          "en": "as a parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.96000000000001,
          "end": 106.22999999999999,
          "en": "and the text to the ticketText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "And that should be string with a lowercase S here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 111.78,
          "en": "That was a little mistake from my side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 113.943,
          "en": "The lowercase S is important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.47,
          "end": 118.473,
          "en": "but with that, I'm then emitting this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.31,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "Now in the TicketsComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 124.68,
          "en": "we can listen to that event in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.68,
          "end": 126.84,
          "en": "So on the app-new-ticket Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.84,
          "end": 130.47,
          "en": "we can listen to that add event and for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 134.403,
          "en": "trigger an onAdd method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 139.8,
          "en": "And to then forward that emitted data to that method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 142.98,
          "en": "we can use the special dollar sign event variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.98,
          "end": 145.89,
          "en": "that is created by Angular here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 148.497,
          "en": "And then go to the TicketsComponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.497,
          "end": 150.633,
          "en": "and add this onAdd method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 154.863,
          "en": "where I will get that ticket data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.88,
          "end": 159,
          "en": "which will have that shape that we set up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159,
          "end": 160.74,
          "en": "in new-ticket,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.74,
          "end": 163.07999999999998,
          "en": "in the NewTicketComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 164.94,
          "en": "So this shape here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.94,
          "end": 168.72,
          "en": "this is the type definition of the data we're emitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.72,
          "end": 170.31,
          "en": "So in the TicketsComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.31,
          "end": 172.833,
          "en": "that's the shape of the data I'm receiving.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 177.06,
          "en": "And we could outsource this into a separate file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.06,
          "end": 180.063,
          "en": "here I'll just duplicate and copy and paste it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.98,
          "end": 184.98,
          "en": "But now we got the Ticket data here in the TicketsComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.24,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "and therefore of course we can create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 189.66,
          "en": "a new ticket constant here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 192.03,
          "en": "which should be of type Ticket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 193.773,
          "en": "So our custom type here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 199.637,
          "en": "where the title will hold the value of ticketData.title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.54,
          "end": 206.54,
          "en": "and request will get ticketData.text as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.84,
          "end": 210.42000000000002,
          "en": "but where we also need to add an id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.42000000000002,
          "end": 214.56,
          "en": "and then also thereafter the status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.56,
          "end": 217.47,
          "en": "Now for the id, I'll use Math.random() here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.47,
          "end": 220.11,
          "en": "and convert this to a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.11,
          "end": 223.53,
          "en": "And of course this doesn't give me a perfectly unique id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.53,
          "end": 225.03,
          "en": "since theoretically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.03,
          "end": 227.55,
          "en": "the same value could be generated twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.55,
          "end": 229.683,
          "en": "But for this dummy app it's good enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.69,
          "end": 234.87,
          "en": "The status then is closed or open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.87,
          "end": 237.213,
          "en": "and I'll start with open here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.52,
          "end": 243.573,
          "en": "Now this Ticket object can be added to this Tickets array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.41,
          "end": 246.33,
          "en": "so we can reach out to this.tickets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.33,
          "end": 249.513,
          "en": "and push this ticket into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.04,
          "end": 252.9,
          "en": "With that, we're then managing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.9,
          "end": 255.42,
          "en": "and updating this tickets array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.42,
          "end": 257.58,
          "en": "and we can then, as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 257.58,
          "end": 261.843,
          "en": "output it here in the template of that Component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
